{"id":"f6bf69669f54adda","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-rewrite-modulo-equations.md","title":"df-rewrite-modulo-equations","display":"df-rewrite-modulo-equations","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-rewrite-modulo-equations","aliases":["56-df-rewrite-modulo-equations"],"display":"df-rewrite-modulo-equations","type":"definition","depends_on":["[[56-df-equational-theory]]","[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]"],"source_section":"14.3.1; 14.3.2","source_pages":"768","source_ocr_blocks":[789],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-rewrite-modulo-equations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-rewrite-modulo-equations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rewrite-modulo-equations"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59b9207cce58252c\" href=\"?note=59b9207cce58252c\" title=\"56-df-equational-theory\">56-df-equational-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"14.3.1; 14.3.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"768"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>789</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq T^2\">\\(E\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}\">\\(\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"59b9207cce58252c\" href=\"?note=59b9207cce58252c\" title=\"56-df-equational-theory\">56-df-equational-theory</a> 的等式理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\">\\(\\to_R\\)</span> 为一步改写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\to_{R/E}t\\iff\n\\exists u,v\\in T\\;(s\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}u\\land u\\to_R v\\land v\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\to_{R/E}t\\iff\n\\exists u,v\\in T\\;(s\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}u\\land u\\to_R v\\land v\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Exercise 14.3.1 将关系模等价定义为等价—一步—等价的复合；这里实例化为等式理论。此处的一步必须包含一个 R 步，仅有 E 转换不算 R/E 步。该定义不同于仅在匹配阶段允许等式的某些实现变体，不能直接替换那些算法的侧条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；14.3.1; 14.3.2，印刷页 768。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-equational-theory","status":"resolved","id":"59b9207cce58252c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-equational-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"55c39f44acb2211c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-equational-theory","status":"resolved","id":"59b9207cce58252c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$E\\subseteq T^2$，$s,t\\in T$。$\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}$ 为 [[56-df-equational-theory]] 的等式理论，$\\to_R$ 为一步改写。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_R","display":false},{"tex":"s\\to_{R/E}t\\iff\n\\exists u,v\\in T\\;(s\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}u\\land u\\to_R v\\land v\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}t).","display":true}],"bytes":1370,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-241","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-modulo-equations.md]]"},{"id":"a7b1b75a0e18bc22","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$E\\subseteq T^2$；$\\to_{R/E}$ 为 [[56-df-rewrite-modulo-equations]] 的等价—一步—等价关系。$\\mathrm{EqModels}_\\Sigma(A,I,E)$ 采用 [[56-df-satisfaction]]，表示 I 解释下所有赋值满足 E。载体存在量词在集合论元语言中遍历非空集合 $A$；$I$ 遍历 $\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}$，$Q\\subseteq A^2$。模型谓词和 [[56-df-interpretation-order]] 的诱导解释序都在合格代数上求值；基本解释终止接口见 [[56-thm-interpretation-termination]]。"}],"outgoing":["59b9207cce58252c","55c39f44acb2211c"]}